NC Digital builds custom ecommerce websites for businesses across South Wales — online stores designed around your brand and built to sell. Based in Merthyr Tydfil, we serve clients from Cardiff and Swansea to the Valleys, delivering professional ecommerce builds with direct, local communication.

Ecommerce sites start from **£800**, depending on your chosen platform, product catalogue size, and the functionality you need.

## Ecommerce platforms for South Wales businesses

We work across three platforms and always recommend what's right for your business specifically. Every build is fully custom-designed — not a template.

**Shopify** — the go-to choice for South Wales product businesses wanting a reliable, scalable store with minimal ongoing maintenance. We custom-design every Shopify store from scratch.

**WooCommerce** — WordPress-based and highly flexible. Ideal for businesses already on WordPress or those needing custom functionality that goes beyond standard ecommerce. Fully custom-designed.

**SureCart** — a modern platform suited to digital products, subscriptions, and service businesses that want to take online payments without managing a large product catalogue. Custom-designed.

## What's included in every South Wales ecommerce build

- Fully custom design tailored to your brand — no off-the-shelf themes
- Mobile-first development — most South Wales shoppers browse on their phones
- Secure checkout with payment gateway integration (Stripe, PayPal, and others)
- Easy product management — update your catalogue yourself after launch
- On-page SEO for product and category pages, ready for Google from day one
- Google Analytics and conversion tracking set up at launch

## A South Wales ecommerce example: AK Promotions

[AK Promotions](https://www.ak-promotions.co.uk/) is a South Wales events and promotions company that uses ecommerce functionality to sell event tickets directly through their website. Since NC Digital built and launched the site, it has generated over 2,800 visits and 75 enquiry submissions without a single penny of paid advertising. [Read the full case study](/portfolio/ak-promotions/).

